"html_url":"https://github.com/Jesusemora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T20:32:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T20:33:48Z","body":"hi, I made some tests in 4.4:\n\nthe problem does not happen with 10 items.\n\nusing 20 items the scrollbar appears. SCROLLING causes the bug.\n\nitems are not changed when scrolling, so we know the data is intact:\n```\ntooltip # 0item 0\ntooltip # 1item 1\ntooltip # 2item 2\ntooltip # 3item 3\ntooltip # 4item 4\ntooltip # 5item 5\ntooltip # 6item 6\ntooltip # 7item 7\ntooltip # 8item 8\ntooltip # 9item 9\n```\n```\ntooltip # 29item 29\ntooltip # 30item 30\ntooltip # 31item 31\ntooltip # 32item 32\ntooltip # 33item 33\ntooltip # 34item 34\ntooltip # 35item 35\ntooltip # 36item 36\ntooltip # 37item 37\ntooltip # 38item 38\ntooltip # 39item 39\n```\n\nI think the problem is with this line `340` of `godot/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp`, it doesn't take scrolling into account:\n\n```c++\nfloat ofs = item_clickable_area.position.y + (float)theme_cache.v_separation * win_scale * 0.5;\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < items.size(); i++) {\n\t\tofs += i > 0 ? (float)theme_cache.v_separation * win_scale : (float)theme_cache.v_separation * win_scale * 0.5;\n\t\tofs += _get_item_height(i) * win_scale;\n\t\tif (p_over.y - control->get_position().y * win_scale < ofs) {\n\t\t\treturn i;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n```\nwe should also get rid of all the magic numbers used or automate it using a function.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730803348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2746167042","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104262#issuecomment-2746167042","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104262","id":2746167042,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jry8C","user":{"login":"ibrahn","id":24498832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDk4ODMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24498832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn","html_url":"https://github.com/ibrahn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-23T11:48:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-23T11:48:44Z","body":"[`PopupMenu::get_tooltip`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2303ce843a362cf5497ca3336451de23793eb711/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L2730-L2736) relies on [`PopupMenu::_get_mouse_over`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2303ce843a362cf5497ca3336451de23793eb711/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L318-L350) to pick the entry. This expects the passed position `Point2` to be given relative to the menu's `Viewport`.\nThe call at [`Viewport::_gui_get_tooltip` ln 1463](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2303ce843a362cf5497ca3336451de23793eb711/scene/main/viewport.cpp#L1463) passes a position relative to the control under the cursor (this is what is expected by `Control::get_tooltip`).\n\nWill PR shortly","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2746167042/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2746488688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104262#issuecomment-2746488688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104262","id":2746488688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jtBdw","user":{"login":"ibrahn","id":24498832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDk4ODMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24498832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn","html_url":"https://github.com/ibrahn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibrahn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-23T22:02:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-23T22:02:28Z","